      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
        服务商宣称的“1000Mbps 极速节点”，其真实可用价值取决于持续吞吐（Sustained Throughput）而非瞬间突发跑分。各类日常网络业务对带宽与丢包的硬性要求如下：
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
