          </div>
          <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            YouTube VP9/AV1 编码 4K 码率在 20–35Mbps 浮动。节点必须具备持续 50Mbps 以上无丢包吞吐，Buffer 缓冲区稳定在 20 秒以上才能免拖动缓冲。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-bold text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>8K HDR 原画流媒体</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold">需 100–150 Mbps</span>
          </div>
