            极度考验节点出口网卡与中转单线程能力。若单线程持续速率低于 80Mbps，8K 播放将频繁出现画质降级或转圈卡顿。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-bold text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>海外电竞与语音 (Discord)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-bold">需 2–5 Mbps</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            带宽需求极小，但对<strong>UDP 丢包率（要求 &lt; 0.5%）</strong>与网络抖动（Jitter &lt; 3ms）极其敏感。专线是唯一能稳定胜任该场景的介质。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-bold text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>AI 大模型与代码仓库</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold">需 10–30 Mbps</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            ChatGPT Stream 流式打字对首字延迟（TTFT）敏感，Git Clone/Docker Pull 则需要持续稳定的 TCP 下行，严禁中途断流。
          </p>
        </div>
